---
// ── The Editor's Note ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Introduction for tiers without margins (<1420px): a resting hairline, the mono
// label, and two note-size sentences with yellow/green specimens on the color
// words. Hidden at the wide tier, where the margin performs the introduction instead.
---

<aside
  id="edition-note"
  class="edition-note"
  aria-label="A note on this edition"
>
  <div class="edition-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="edition-label">Interactive</div>
  <p class="edition-text">
    Highlighted terms are interactive. Click to reveal detail.
  </p>
  <p class="edition-text edition-text--pens">
    <span class="edition-specimen edition-specimen--note hs-mark-3"
      ><span class="hs-stroke">Yellow</span></span
    > highlight opens in page note; <span
      class="edition-specimen edition-specimen--project hs-mark-6"
      ><span class="hs-stroke">green</span></span
    > navigates to the project detail.
  </p>
</aside>
